message: "If you use or reference this framework, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "The Newtation GEO Audit Framework"
abstract: >-
  An open method for auditing how AI engines such as ChatGPT, Perplexity,
  Claude, Gemini, Google AI Overviews and Microsoft Copilot find, understand,
  trust and cite a brand. It scores access, entity, extractability, structure
  and corroboration, and measures citation rate across engines.
